+
+The wheel check installs one built wheel into a fresh temporary environment without
+index access or dependencies. From outside the source tree it checks both entry points,
+the installed version, resource checksums, model indexes, typing marker, and ERPIN permissions.
+Keep only the intended wheel in `dist/`, or pass its exact filename. Source tests remain
+separate because maintenance scripts and benchmark fixtures are not wheel contents.
 
 Runtime and resource provenance are documented in [THIRD_PARTY.md](THIRD_PARTY.md).
 
